    "body": "CONTRIBUTING.md should be for contributors. We'd put stuff there like the 100-character line limit, or a link to legacy open bugs, or commit message format guidelines. So far we're keeping that in the readme.\n\nCOLLABORATORS.md is what I envision being used only for the people who plan to be pushing.\n",
